      "text": "Nine of the fourteen are passes. Stage 14 is a different program, and stages 1 to 4\nhappen before the first line of passes.def runs.",
      "originalText": "Nine of the fourteen are passes. Stage 14 is a different program, and stages 1 to 4\nhappen before the first line of passes.def runs.",
