      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "after parse       a GENERIC tree, one node per expression\nafter gimplify    a GIMPLE sequence, three address form\nafter tree-cfg    basic blocks and edges, statements inside them\nafter tree-ssa    every name written once, phi nodes at the joins\nafter expand      an insn chain, RTX trees, and the same CFG\nafter ira, lra    the same chain with hard registers in it\nafter final       a text file, and nothing else",
      "originalText": "after parse       a GENERIC tree, one node per expression\nafter gimplify    a GIMPLE sequence, three address form\nafter tree-cfg    basic blocks and edges, statements inside them\nafter tree-ssa    every name written once, phi nodes at the joins\nafter expand      an insn chain, RTX trees, and the same CFG\nafter ira, lra    the same chain with hard registers in it\nafter final       a text file, and nothing else",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "box015",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt017",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 890,
      "width": 1032.3,
      "height": 37.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 134623,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1780393,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The stage names are the easy half. The right hand column is the half people get wrong, and the one to check\nyourself on: the CFG appears before SSA and outlives it, and the insn chain and the CFG exist at the same time.",
      "originalText": "The stage names are the easy half. The right hand column is the half people get wrong, and the one to check\nyourself on: the CFG appears before SSA and outlives it, and the insn chain and the CFG exist at the same time.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
