    {
      "id": "txt025",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 182.38,
      "y": 1118.75,
      "width": 435.24,
      "height": 162.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 197975,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2618225,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "l2.c:10   return dx * dx + dy * dy;\n\neinline      the statements move into nearest, twice\nrelease_ssa  the names are renumbered, nothing else\nsink1        one of them moves nearer its use\nifcvt        a second copy appears, for the vectorizer\nvect         the vectorizer says no, the copy goes\nexpand       mults and adds, as separate insns\ncombine      a mult and a plus fuse, twice\nfinal        maddsi prints  madd w7, w7, w7, w3",
      "originalText": "l2.c:10   return dx * dx + dy * dy;\n\neinline      the statements move into nearest, twice\nrelease_ssa  the names are renumbered, nothing else\nsink1        one of them moves nearer its use\nifcvt        a second copy appears, for the vectorizer\nvect         the vectorizer says no, the copy goes\nexpand       mults and adds, as separate insns\ncombine      a mult and a plus fuse, twice\nfinal        maddsi prints  madd w7, w7, w7, w3",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "box024",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt026",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 1070,
      "width": 734.7,
      "height": 93.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 205894,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2722954,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Two of the eight rows are not what anyone means by a pass changing the code.\nrelease_ssa only moved the numbers, and ifcvt made a copy that vect threw away.\n\nThey are on the list because the evidence says so, and working out why they are\nthere is more of the lesson than the six that did real work.",
      "originalText": "Two of the eight rows are not what anyone means by a pass changing the code.\nrelease_ssa only moved the numbers, and ifcvt made a copy that vect threw away.\n\nThey are on the list because the evidence says so, and working out why they are\nthere is more of the lesson than the six that did real work.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt027",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 1230,
      "width": 771.9,
      "height": 56.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 213813,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2827683,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The IR grows before it shrinks. Fifty eight statements at ifcvt, thirty four at the\nend. Inline first so there is something to work with, then spend two hundred\npasses taking it back apart.",
      "originalText": "The IR grows before it shrinks. Fifty eight statements at ifcvt, thirty four at the\nend. Inline first so there is something to work with, then spend two hundred\npasses taking it back apart.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "txt028",
